/Title (Market Scale: The $60.9 billion global fire safety market is projected to grow by 50% in eight years, alongside India's accelerating $2.0 billion market. To achieve industrial certification, standard sensors and microcontrollers must be replaced with Aspirating Smoke Detectors \(VESDA\), Multi-Spectrum IR/UV sensors, and PLCs for high-stakes reliability. Additionally, lightweight servos and canisters should be swapped for industrial BLDC drives and manifold-fed delivery systems housed in explosion-proof stainless steel.)
